OL,3,AMayfair club shuts as Met investigates
OL,4,Aweapon claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA private members' club popular with
OL,7,Fcelebrities has temporarily closed
OL,8,Fwhile police investigate allegations of
OL,9,Fthreatening behaviour and whether a
OL,10,Fweapon was brandished in a nearby
OL,11,Fstreet.
OL,13,FThe Metropolitan Police said it asked
OL,14,FWestminster City Council to review
OL,15,FMaison Estelle's alcohol licence as the
OL,16,Fpremises was "allegedly associated with
OL,17,Fserious crime, or serious disorder, or
OL,18,Fboth".
OL,20,FIt related to an incident on 19
OL,21,FSeptember, the force said. No injuries
OL,22,Fwere reported.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
