OL,3,AMayfair club shuts as Met investigates
OL,4,Aweapon claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors suspended the licence at a
OL,7,Fprivate hearing on Thursday. The
OL,8,FMayfair venue, which has hosted
OL,9,FPrincess Beatrice, Idris Elba and Kim
OL,10,FKardashian, said it would be closed for
OL,11,F"a few weeks" while investigations took
OL,12,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
